1012. Tokyo also pass CINCUNC, CG AFFE Eight and CAG. CINCUNC pass Stassen,
                        Wood. Governor Stassen arrived
                    Seoul eight a.m. March 7; conferences President
                        Rhee two p.m., 7th; ten a.m., 8th;
                    formal dinner Pres Rhee seven p.m., 7th;
                    press conference two p.m., 8th; departure three p.m., 8th.
